      "props": {
        "content": "The redesigned renderer supports twelve ways to draw a diagram. Each chapter below shows one, using real examples from this week's work. Use the editorial ones first: steps, map, story, sequence, timeline and trend. The specialised ones cover code review, state and file layout. Mermaid and the SVG sandbox are last resorts."
      }
